    "Name": "Marauder IIC BR",
    "Details": "This Marauder 2C has been extensively Upgraded to be a Close Range Menace. 2 Ultra Autocannons 20 and 3 Heavy Improved Medium Lasers are Extremely dangerous in Close Combat. While the Movement of the Mech has not been Touched, it will generally be enough of a Threat to your units to draw enough Attention. While one might think this Mech is very hot, the Arms have been specially Modified to alleviate this Issue.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.27</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
